      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Example Locations Data\n\n| location | latitude | longitude | radius |\n|----------|----------|-----------|--------|\n| San Francisco | 37.7749 | -122.4194 | 25 |\n| New York | 40.7128 | -74.0060 | 30 |\n| London | 51.5074 | -0.1278 | 20 |\n| Berlin | 52.5200 | 13.4050 | 25 |\n\n## Common Topic Mappings\n\n| topic | category_id |\n|-------|-------------|\n| technology | 34 |\n| ai/machine learning | 34 |\n| software | 34 |\n| fitness | 9 |\n| arts | 1 |\n| music | 18 |\n| outdoors | 20 |\n| business | 3 |",
